    "output": "# 综合解析报告\n\n## 核心概念\n查询词包含“Slot Hold”与系统标识。\n\n### Slot Hold\n指赌场预期从下注中保留的资金比例[8]。如5%保留率即每100美元下注产生5美元收入[8]，近年因高保留率游戏普及而上升[8]。\n\n### E2E与Slot\n“E2E”指端到端（如Kubernetes测试[7]），“Slot”指部署槽位。`slot-e2e-a-1786258556` 为特定系统的端到端测试用例或槽位标识符，用于追踪资源分配。\n\n## 参考文献\n\n<a id=\"ref-1\"></a>**[1]** ahdictionary.com — American Heritage Dictionary Entry: slot\nURL: https://www.ahdictionary.com/word/search.html?q=slot\n原文片段：「American Heritage Dictionary Entry: slot HOW TO USE THE DICTIONARY To look up an entry in The American Heritage Dictionary of the English Language, use the search window above. For best results, after typing in the word, click on the “Search” button instead of using the “enter” k...」\n\n<a id=\"ref-2\"></a>**[2]** community.gamedev.tv — Creating an equipment slot that can hold multiple types of items - Ask - GameDev.tv\nURL: https://community.gamedev.tv/t/creating-an-equipment-slot-that-can-hold-multiple-types-of-items/249066\n原文片段：「Creating an equipment slot that can hold multiple types of items - Ask - GameDev.tv Creating an equipment slot that can hold multiple types of items Unity Courses Ask 3d , rpg Darthsword July 16, 2024, 3:51am 1 Here’s the rundown, I’m using the Inventory system developed in the R...」\n\n<a id=\"ref-3\"></a>**[3]** primecasino.co.uk — Slot Features: Types & How They Work\nURL: https://www.primecasino.co.uk/blog/guides/slot-features-explained\n原文片段：「Slot Features: Types & How They Work Home What's New Journal Guides Slot Features Explained: Types, Functions, and What UK Players Should Know Guides Published: 3 Jul 2025 | Updated: 9 Jul 2025 Ever wondered what really powers your favourite online slot games? It’s not just the b...」\n\n<a id=\"ref-4\"></a>**[4]** wizardofvegas.com — Slot machine hold percentage discussed in General Discussion/Off-Topic at Wizard of Vegas\nURL: https://wizardofvegas.com/forum/off-topic/general/19656-slot-machine-hold-percentage\n原文片段：「Slot machine hold percentage discussed in General Discussion/Off